                                                "sense_id": "d39dcb07-c2b3-32aa-a04d-5f3d6ac402b8",
                                                "text": "[…] lost in such a jungle of intrigues, pettifoggings, treacheries, diplomacies domestic and foreign […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "885cae46-5d52-45d1-affb-9b4e0fae97b6",
                                                "sense_id": "d39dcb07-c2b3-32aa-a04d-5f3d6ac402b8",
                                                "text": "It's lots of other pettifogging, degrading things. Things you have to endure, things you never have to think about until they happen to you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
